BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 574.80 Tm (Date: 15 August 2026) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 561.60 Tm (Subject: Shortening of the potassium monitoring interval - CardioZen with) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 548.40 Tm (chronic kidney disease) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 522.00 Tm (| SYNTHETIC DOCUMENT - NOT REAL MEDICAL GUIDANCE. Fabricated for a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 508.80 Tm (| software demonstration. CardioZen is an invented medication. Nothing here) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 495.60 Tm (| describes a real product or should inform any clinical decision.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 482.40 Tm (>) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 469.20 Tm (| HELD BACK FROM THE SYSTEM. This document is deliberately not loaded) Tj ET
