BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 442.80 Tm (| a new document to a governed, active monitoring rule. See) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 429.60 Tm (| docs/self-tracking/03_SCHEMA_DESIGN.md section 13.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 403.20 Tm (1. Why we are revising) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 376.80 Tm (In March of this year the Committee issued SAFETY_DOC_007, which required) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 363.60 Tm (serum potassium to be checked at least every three months for patients) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 350.40 Tm (receiving CardioZen with a diagnosis of chronic kidney disease. Five months of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 337.20 Tm (operating experience is now available.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 310.80 Tm (Two findings prompt this revision. First, among patients who did develop) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 297.60 Tm (clinically significant potassium elevation while compliant with the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 284.40 Tm (three-month interval, the elevation was in most cases detectable earlier than) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 271.20 Tm (the next scheduled measurement would have caught it. Second, the interval) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 258.00 Tm (performed least well in precisely the group at highest risk - those with the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 244.80 Tm (most reduced renal function - because in that group accumulation proceeds) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 231.60 Tm (faster than the interval assumes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 205.20 Tm (The Committee's judgement is that the interval published in March is too long) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 192.00 Tm (for this population.) Tj ET
BT /F2 11.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 165.60 Tm (2. Revised requirement) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 139.20 Tm (For patients receiving CardioZen who have a recorded diagnosis of chronic) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 126.00 Tm (kidney disease, serum potassium must be checked every 60 days for the duration) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 112.80 Tm (of therapy.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 86.40 Tm (This replaces the three-month interval published in SAFETY_DOC_007 section 3.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.0 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 73.20 Tm (It takes effect on the date of this memorandum.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8 Tf 1 0 0 1 62 40 Tm (Page 1 of 2 - SYNTHETIC DEMONSTRATION DOCUMENT) Tj ET
